		"- &cBaked Potato:&r Incendiary."
		"- &6Golden Apple:&r High damage."
		"- &aPumpkin Seed:&r Knockback."
	]
	quest.0000000000009300.title: "Defense: The Potato Cannon"
	quest.0000000000009400.quest_desc: [
		"&3Copper Backtank:&r Provides air underwater AND powers pneumatic tools (Potato Cannon, Extendo Grip)."
