	quest.0184E6EC132B61DD.quest_desc: ["The Bronze Dungeon is a large labyrinth-shaped structure made of carved stone and sentry stone. This structure is often found inside large islands, with only the entrance exposed to the air. Holystone ruins on the surface indicate an entrance to a Bronze Dungeon below. It is inhabited by sentries, mimics, and the Bronze Dungeon boss, the Slider. "]
