	quest.05CB67FD31CBE90B.quest_desc: [
		"The §cArchmage Spell Book§r is the holy grail of the ultimate mage!"
		""
		"§lExtreme Capabilities:§r"
		"• Equip §610 spells§r simultaneously (vs 10 for Novice)"
		"• Stores §51000 Source§r internally (!)"
		"• §a-25% cost§r on ALL spells (monumental reduction)"
		"• Compatible with Unbreaking and Mending"
		""
		"§lCraft in the Enchanting Apparatus:§r"
		"Required ingredients:"
		"  • 1x Apprentice Spell Book (base)"
		"  • 4x Wilden Tribute (intense combat!)"
		"  • 2x Blaze Rod (Nether)"
		"  • 1x Nether Star (Ultimate Boss)"
		"  • §e5000 Source§r (HUGE reservoir)"
		""
		"§lAbsurd advantages:§r"
		"• Cast complex spells fearlessly"
		"• The -25% reduction stacks with armor"
		"• 1000 Source = LONG magic sessions"
		"• All your spells at your fingertips"
		"• Enables impossible combos"
		""
		"§lIntegration with other mods:§r"
		"• Uses §6Ars Creo§r powers"
		"• Combines with §dArs Nouveau§r rituals"
		"• Benefits from §bArs Addition§r extensions"
		"• Automation via §cArs Technica§r"
		"• Dark magic from §9Ars Ocultas§r"
		""
		"§5★ CONGRATULATIONS!§r"
		"You are now a true ARCHMAGE!"
		"The world of magic holds no more secrets for you."
		"It's time to create devastating spells!"
	]
