	quest.0833472E1FCFA868.quest_desc: [
		"Needed to make coal coke. It is advised to make multiple ovens to create more coal coke. Right click the front with a wrench after to finish the oven, then, add a chute on top to add in the coal. "
		""
		"Do know that it was also create creosote and the oven will stop working if there is too much creosote. You can pump creosote out into a tank (creosote will be needed) by placing pumps on the ovens."
		""
		"Coke ovens will also create carbon dioxide, so craft an exhaust to get rid of them as well."
	]
