	quest.0FCF8B151CFD2647.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the complete Ars universe!"
		""
		"You will explore 6 extraordinary magical mods:"
		"§5★ Ars Nouveau§r - The foundation: magic, glyphs and spells"
		"§6★ Ars Creo§r - Alchemy: potions and transmutations"
		"§a★ Ars Delight§r - Cooking: enchanted foods"
		"§b★ Ars Addition§r - Extensions: new mechanics"
		"§c★ Ars Technica§r - Technology: magical automation"
		"§9★ Ars Ocultas§r - Dark Magic: advanced rituals"
		""
		"The §dNovice Spell Book§r is your first step."
		"Get it and embark on this magical adventure!"
