		""
		"§lMagical Foods:§r"
		"§e★ Sweet Berry Jam§r"
		"  Slow but powerful regeneration"
		"  Perfect for long exploration"
		""
		"§e★ Enchanted Bread§r"
		"  Instantly restores Source"
		"  Essential for mages in combat"
		""
		"§e★ Spiced Meat§r"
		"  +20% damage for 2 minutes"
		"  Temporary offensive boost"
		""
		"§e★ Honey Cakes§r"
		"  PERMANENT magical buff"
		"  Persistent effect even after respawn"
		""
		"§lHow to cook:§r"
		"Use the §eArcane Kitchen§r with ingredients from Ars Creo"
		""
		"§aAdvantages:§r"
		"• Portable and lightweight consumables"
		"• Powerful and varied effects"
		"• Cumulative buffs (can eat multiple)"
		"• Perfect for dangerous adventures"
		""
		"§cLink with Ars Creo:§r Use potions and reagents from Ars Creo as a base!"
	]
