	quest.249F79ABD2B285D7.quest_desc: [
		"The §6Scribes Table§r is your magical creation workshop!"
		""
		"§lHow to create a spell:§r"
		"1. Place a §eSpell Parchment§r or your spell book"
		"2. Select glyphs: §cFORM → EFFECT → AUGMENT§r"
		"3. Each added glyph increases Source cost"
		"4. Confirm and your spell is created!"
		""
		"§lSimple combo examples:§r"
		"§cProjectile§r + §4Harm§r = Basic bolt"
		"§cProjectile§r + §4Harm§r + §6Amplify§r = Powerful bolt"
		"§cProjectile§r + §4Harm§r + §dAOE§r = Explosion"
		"§cProjectile§r + §4Harm§r + §ePierce§r = Piercing arrow"
		""
		"§lBook capabilities:§r"
		"• Stores up to §610 different spells§r"
		"• Each spell can be progressively improved"
		"• Switch spells using hotkeys"
		""
		"§aTip:§r Start simple, then make your spells more complex!"
	]
