	quest.25F8E556163AD58A.quest_desc: [
		"§6Ars Creo§r adds a complete alchemy system!"
		""
		"§lMain features:§r"
		"• §6Alchemy Cauldron§r: Brews magical potions"
		"• §eAlchemical Reagents§r: Special alchemical ingredients"
		"• §5Transmutation Recipes§r: Converts raw materials"
		"• §dAlchemical Flasks§r: Stores and transports potions"
		"• §aSource Concoctions§r: Source-enhanced potions"
		""
		"§lImportant recipes:§r"
		"• Source Reagent → Purifies and concentrates magic"
		"• Mana Draught → Instantly restores Source"
		"• Alchemical Dyes → Unique magical dyes"
		"• Alchemical Compounds → Base materials"
		""
		"§lLinks with other mods:§r"
		"• Ars Creo potions are used in §aArs Delight§r"
		"• Reagents are used in §bArs Addition§r recipes"
		"• Dyes enhance §9Ars Ocultas§r rituals"
		""
		"§cTip:§r Alchemy is the key to unlocking the potential of the other mods!"
	]
