	quest.26D17039599CF775.quest_subtitle: "Okay so, andesite is a very abundant stone that you can find in large pockets underground, and they blend really well with the stone texture so keep your eyes open for some. You'll need a lot of this stone if you are going to make any machinery around here so dig as much as you can! Mental note as well, Zinc ores are important too as using it with andesite makes the important alloy used to making machinery."
