	quest.3000000000000002.title: "&cThe Slider"
	quest.3000000000000003.quest_desc: ["The chest contained legendary weapons. A lance, a hammer that shoots projectiles, and magical artifacts like this cloud staff. I'm starting to feel powerful."]
	quest.3000000000000003.quest_subtitle: "&6Tools of the Ancients"
	quest.3000000000000003.title: "&6Legacy of the Slider"
	quest.3000000000000004.quest_desc: ["With Gravitite ore (enchanted at the altar), I've forged this equipment. If I wear the full armor, I can make prodigious leaps. My tools also seem lighter."]
