	quest.388585F7BEA4B814.quest_desc: [
		"Familiars are magical creatures that assist you!"
		""
		"§l§dStarbuncle§r§r :"
		"• Automatically collects and transports items"
		"• Can be linked to chests with a §eStarbuncle Charm§r"
		"• Use a §6Dominion Wand§r to configure it"
		""
		"§l§eWhirlisprig§r§r :"
		"• Automatically cultivates and harvests plants"
		"• Accelerates crop growth"
		"• Perfect for automating your magical farms"
		""
		"§l§9Drygmy§r§r :"
		"• Generates resources from nearby mobs"
		"• Requires a §aDrygmy Charm§r and §cWilden Horns§r"
		"• The more mobs around, the more it produces!"
		""
		"§7How to summon them:§r Use the §5Summon§r spell or craft their charms in the Enchanting Apparatus."
	]
	quest.388585F7BEA4B814.quest_subtitle: "§7Invoquer des compagnons arcaniques§r"
	quest.388585F7BEA4B814.title: "§5Les Familiers Magiques§r"
	quest.388610194F632EE9.title: "Hunter: Minotaur (800)"
	quest.3887DB2CA518BC26.quest_subtitle: "A useful block for building contraptions."
	quest.388BBB6A618A4CA5.title: "Hunter: Skeleton Druid (600)"
	quest.388D5EC7B3DF64B6.quest_desc: [
		"All of Create is based around Create, obviously, a steampunk mod that lets you build contraptions to do most things you can think of, just not how to do your laundry nor your homework, okay?"
		""
		"Create offers great guides for most of its items by hovering over them in REI or in your inventory and holding down 'W' to \"ponder\" the item, but sometimes it's just best to test each thing out, go big or go home, as the saying goes."
		""
		"Because of this, the chapter is mostly focused on letting you know what exists and giving you a rough outline of the progression of the mod, but at the same time, it will not handhold you all the way to the end since Create is a free for all sandbox mechanic mod. Get building and be smarter."
	]
	quest.388D5EC7B3DF64B6.quest_subtitle: "&8[Click to read]"
