	quest.471B8AB62F9A9BC9.quest_desc: [
		"§eSource§r is the very essence of all magic!"
		""
		"§lWhat is Source?§r"
		"• The vital energy that powers your spells"
		"• Required to cast every magical glyph"
		"• Regenerates naturally through specific elements"
		""
		"§lHow to generate Source:§r"
		"• §aMagebloom§r: Plant that passively generates Source"
		"• §aSource Berries§r: Edible magical berries"
		"• §aSource Links§r: Energy transfer connections"
		""
		"§lLe §eSource Jar§r :§r"
		"Stores up to 10,000 units of Source."
		"Place multiple Jars side by side to interconnect them!"
		""
		"§cPro tip:§r Create a Magebloom farm to generate Source continuously."
	]
