	quest.5C24F7AD1FDC0D8D.quest_desc: [
		"§6Glyphs§r are the foundation of every spell in Ars Nouveau."
		""
		"There are 3 categories of glyphs:"
		"• §cForms§r: How the spell is cast (Projectile, Touch, Self...)"
		"• §9Effects§r: What the spell does (Harm, Heal, Break...)"
		"• §aAugments§r: Modifies the spell (Amplify, Extend Time...)"
		""
		"§7How to get glyphs:§r"
		"Find §dArchwood Trees§r in the world, harvest their wood and create a §6Scribes Table§r to copy glyphs from the §5Worn Notebook§r."
	]
