		"§lSetup:§r"
		"• Place the Enchanting Apparatus in the center"
		"• Surround it with 8 §eArcane Pedestals§r (exactly 2 blocks away)"
		"• Connect them with §5Arcane Cores§r buried underground"
		"• Power with a §eSource Jar§r nearby"
		""
		"§lEssential recipes:§r"
		"• §5Spell Parchment§r: Creates reusable spells"
		"• §dMagebloom§r: Passively generates Source"
		"• §6Advanced Glyphs§r: Unlocks new powers"
		"• §eSource Gems§r: Stores large amounts of energy"
		"• §3Mage Robes§r: Powerful magical equipment"
		""
		"§lCosts:§r"
		"Each recipe consumes a large amount of Source."
		"Plan your energy production!"
		""
		"§cImportant:§r This is where you'll create items for Ars Creo, Delight, Addition, Technica and Ocultas!"
	]
