	quest.77CA839D8ADDB9B4.quest_desc: [" The Sun Spirit cannot be killed by attacking it directly and must be killed by hitting the white object it throws at you multiple times. Each time it is hit with the white object, it sends a smaller version of itself to attack the player. Once the player kills the Sun Spirit, the sun will finally set in the Aether. Before the player kills the Sun Spirit, the sun will never set. If the player fails to kill the Sun Spirit, their spawn point will be reset to lava, forcing the player to delete the map. "]
