	quest.7E4358B982AAB01F.quest_desc: [
		"§dRituals§r allow you to perform powerful and automated magic!"
		""
		"§lRitual Setup:§r"
		"1. Place a §5Ritual Brazier§r in the center"
		"2. Add §eArcane Pedestals§r around (specific pattern per ritual)"
		"3. Power with Source via Source Jars"
		"4. Activate with a §6Dominion Wand§r"
		""
		"§lUseful rituals:§r"
		"• §aGrowth Ritual§r: Accelerates crops in an area"
		"• §cAviary Ritual§r: Generates passive mobs"
		"• §9Extraction Ritual§r: Mines automatically"
		"• §6Manifestation Ritual§r: Complex automatic crafts"
		""
		"§7Note:§r Each ritual has a constant Source cost and specific ingredients!"
		""
		"§aPro tip:§r Combine rituals with your Drygmys for complete automation!"
	]
